                    <article><span>02</span><h3><span lang="fr">Construire</span><span lang="en">Build</span></h3><p><span lang="fr">Architecture simple, code lisible et automatisation utile.</span><span lang="en">Simple architecture, readable code and useful automation.</span></p></article>
